1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,647
Ava bought a notebook for the stories she wanted to write.

2
00:00:03,647 --> 00:00:06,102
But the first page had to be perfect.

3
00:00:06,102 --> 00:00:07,367
So she waited.

4
00:00:07,367 --> 00:00:08,617
A better idea.

5
00:00:08,617 --> 00:00:09,882
A better pen.

6
00:00:09,882 --> 00:00:11,705
The page stayed blank.

7
00:00:11,705 --> 00:00:16,264
One evening, she wrote a terrible sentence... and left it there.

8
00:00:16,264 --> 00:00:18,779
The next day, she wrote another.

9
00:00:18,779 --> 00:00:24,720
A month later, the notebook was full of crossed-out words... and actual stories.

10
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:27,132
That first page was never perfect.

11
00:00:27,132 --> 00:00:29,088
It just needed to exist.

